  "instructions": [
    "Bring a small pot of water to a simmer and dissolve 1/4 cup of sea salt to create a quick brine.",
    "Submerge the lamb fillet in the brine for 10 minutes, then pat dry with paper towels.",
    "Arrange the chilled lamb slices on a chilled plate, forming an overlapping fan shape.",
    "Drizzle the warmed apricot jam over the lamb, allowing it to pool in the center.",
    "Sprinkle sumac, za'atar, cumin, coriander, sea salt, and black pepper evenly over the lamb.",
    "Add lemon juice and olive oil, then gently shuffle the slices to coat.",
    "Garnish with chopped mint and parsley, and give a final sprinkle of sea salt.",
    "Serve immediately with a side of flatbread or a small salad."
  ],
